# Crate boundaries

Dependency direction: `hexplace` → `hexplace-engine` → `hexplace-core`.

| Crate | Owns |
| --- | --- |
| `hexplace-core` | Types + traits (`PlaceStore`, `TextSearcher`, `SpatialSearcher`, `Geocoder`) |
| `hexplace-engine` | Import, mmap columnar store, Tantivy, H3 CSR, `Engine` |
| `hexplace` | CLI + HTTP; thin handlers over `Geocoder` / `Engine` |

Rules:

- Core must not depend on engine or HTTP types
- Prefer static dispatch inside the engine; HTTP holds `Arc<Engine>`
- Put new domain traits in core; wire concretes at the composition root
- For deeper SOLID guidance, use skill `solid-rust`
